  "summary": "In January 2018 OFAC designated the Zhao Wei Transnational Criminal Organization, based in the Golden Triangle Special Economic Zone in Bokeo, Laos, citing drug trafficking, human trafficking, money laundering, bribery and wildlife trafficking facilitated through the Kings Romans Casino. Later reporting described call-centre scam operations in the zone, including 11 Indian nationals rescued in 2022 after being promised IT jobs abroad. In August 2024 Lao authorities ordered illegal call centres to leave the zone after raids that led to 1,389 arrests and deportations.",
